<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>How about ♥?</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Hangsung</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">How about ♥?</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7a1WunmBe0907q7VwE9yIC</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.600" end="00:09.600">I'm so tired cause she was jump over my boundary</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.600" end="00:13.990">Can't anyone stop her?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.990" end="00:16.070">Feeling kind of nervous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.070" end="00:19.960">I'm gonna ask you something now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.960" end="00:22.540">So, I just wish you tell me everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.540" end="00:29.940">I've been searching you without knowing time was passing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.940" end="00:33.450">Whatcha gonna do?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.450" end="00:35.820">Nobody can be instead of you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.820" end="00:38.270">But life goes on and on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.270" end="00:42.380">So, How about lover you and I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.380" end="00:45.010">You always hold in my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.010" end="00:49.950">I tried to get out on my own</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.950" end="00:51.700">The time goes so fast</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.700" end="00:53.200">And she said</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.670" end="00:55.060">You're always in all my time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.060" end="00:59.780">And everything she said, she lied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.780" end="01:07.780">What the hell am I supposed to do?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.180" end="01:14.680">I'm so tired</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.630" end="01:18.710">So, I am hanging on my last thread</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.710" end="01:22.640">Can't anyone stop me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.640" end="01:25.410">Nobody can be instead of you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.410" end="01:27.820">But life goes on and on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.820" end="01:32.230">So, How about lover you and I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.230" end="01:34.340">You always hold in my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.340" end="01:39.340">I tried to get out on my own</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.340" end="01:40.840">The time goes so fast</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.710" end="01:42.210">And she said</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.960" end="01:44.390">You're always in all my time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.390" end="01:48.770">And everything she said, she lied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.770" end="01:56.770">That is why I love you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.990" end="02:06.990">I'm so sick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.970" end="02:11.650">I'm so sick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.650" end="02:13.990">You always hold in my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.990" end="02:18.440">I tried to get out on my own</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.440" end="02:20.230">The time goes so fast</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.230" end="02:21.730">And she said</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.420" end="02:23.890">You're always in all my time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.890" end="02:28.380">And everything she said, she lied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.380" end="02:31.840">What the hell am I supposed to do?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.840" end="02:33.660">You always hold in my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.660" end="02:38.160">I tried to get out on my own</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.160" end="02:40.040">The time goes so fast</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.040" end="02:41.540">And she said</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.200" end="02:43.670">You're always in all my time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.670" end="02:48.320">And everything she said, she lied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.320" end="02:51.680">What the hell am I supposed to do?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.680" end="02:55.680" /></div></body></tt>